## Relatedness table for the house banner + house interstitial (owner 2026-10-26): per host, our OTHER games, most related
## first. GENERATED by games/tools/ads/house_related.py from the games' Play listing tags — edit the tags there and
## regenerate, never this list by hand. Copy unchanged next to CoddyBanner.gd / CoddyAds.gd in every game
## (bash games/tools/ads/sync.sh <game>).
##
## apply(config, host) rewrites ads-config `houseAds` IN PLACE (idempotent, marker houseAds._related):
##   * pool: each format's sequence gets the other format's creatives it lacks (older backends served a different
##     window per format, so a host's most related games could sit in the OTHER format's list);
##   * drops the host itself and kids games (never self-promotion);
##   * orders by RELATED[host] (ids missing from this table — a game newer than this build — after the known ones, in
##     backend order, never cut) and keeps them ALL when TOP_N = 0 (2026-10-28), else the TOP_N most related.
## Both the house banner and the host's interstitial layer read the same dictionary, so one call orders both.
## Installed-game detection: not possible (Godot has no package query; Android 11+ would need QUERY_ALL_PACKAGES) — the
## rotation does not skip installed games.

